# Registry bootstrap for scripts/deploy.sh. Copy to testnet.registry, fill in
# the real addresses, and run:  REGISTRY=deployments/testnet.registry scripts/deploy.sh
# One entry per line; blank lines and # comments are ignored. Order matters:
# a warehouse must be registered before its custodians.
#
# warehouse  WH_KANO_01
# custodian  WH_KANO_01 G...
# verifier   G...
# operator   G...
